{"operations":[{"content":"# Core hours\n\nCore working hours are set from 09:00 to 15:00 on working days, effective 1 October 2026 [[cite:obs-7b98c4bcf2465ab320c11ebcb72be6c51289310d \"Core hours are set from 09:00 to 15:00 on working days, effective 1 October 2026.\"]].\n\nWhere the board resolution of 15 September 2026 and the staff handbook differ, the resolution applies [[cite:obs-7b98c4bcf2465ab320c11ebcb72be6c51289310d \"Core hours are set from 09:00 to 15:00 on working days, effective 1 October 2026.\"]].\n","expected_sha256":"6fbc5e506736e896607474e215cbd5b6c4c6f1876657bb8a1e867c955af51996","kind":"modify","path":"doc/hours.md"}],"rationale":"Removed the statement quoting the staff handbook core hours (10:00 to 16:00) because the board resolution overrides it; kept only the board resolution hours with correct citations."}